{#-
  Where MONEI sends the customer back after paying (completeUrl, src/api/monei.js).
  Arriving here proves nothing: the customer can type the URL, and MONEI says the
  redirect does not guarantee the payment went through. Only MONEI's callback
  confirms the order and sends the emails, so this page promises nothing but
  that. It empties the cart (web/cart.js, on #order-received) because the
  order already exists; the cart is deliberately kept until now so that a
  customer who cancels on MONEI's page comes back to it intact.
-#}
<main class="site-page"><div class="site-page-inner">
  <h1 class="reveal">Pedido recibido</h1>
  <div id="order-received" class="site-page-body">
    <p>Gracias por tu pedido. Estamos confirmando tu pago con el banco.</p>
    <p>En cuanto lo recibamos te enviaremos un email con el resumen. Si en unos minutos no lo ves, revisa la carpeta de spam{% if site.biz_phone %} o llámanos al {{ site.biz_phone }}{% endif %}.</p>
    <p><a href="/productos">Volver al catálogo</a></p>
  </div>
</div></main>
